# The Generate and Judge Project

Throughout Thinking Critically About AI, students continuously build and revise a project called the **Generate and Judge Guide**. 

Rather than completing one final project at the end of the unit, students add evidence, examples, reflections, and recommendations as they investigate AI systems across multiple lessons.

This structure helps students develop more thoughtful and evidence-based conclusions over time.

## Project Development

The Generate and Judge Guide develops across the unit as students add evidence, examples, tips, and reflections from their AI investigations. This timeline focuses only on the moments when students add directly to the guide.

