## Instructional Focus

The Generate and Judge Guide is designed to help students continuously revise and strengthen their thinking rather than treating learning as a one-time activity.

As students revisit the project throughout the unit, look for opportunities to:
* Push students toward more specific evidence and examples
* Encourage conditional thinking instead of simple “AI is good/bad” conclusions
* Ask students to explain why they trust or distrust an AI output
* Help students connect individual investigations to broader conclusions about responsible AI use
